					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TRIGGER IN\n\nThe Trigger In node creates an input node for triggers.\nThis creates an interactive element in the patch.\nAs with all input nodes, the Trigger In node will be placed in the Dashboard panel.\nHere you can rearrange where the Trigger In should be placed in the interface.\n\nThe Trigger In node sends out a trigger event when pressed.\nThe Trigger type is used to trigger other nodes like Random, Shuffle, Attack Release and Timeline."
					}
				},
