					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE: RESETTING SINE\n\nIn this example we've made Trigger In node and renamed it to \"Reset\".\nThe trigger is then connected to the reset phase inlet of the Sine Oscillator.\nThis allows us to reset the Sine with a press of a button."
					}
				},
